$$\begin{aligned}-1\le\cos\left(x+\frac{\pi}{3}\right)&\le1\\-2\le y&\le4\\T&=\frac{2\pi}{1}=2\pi\end{aligned}$$
Жауабы: $E(y)=[-2;\ 4]$, $T=2\pi$.
